      "writtenOn": "2026-07-17T15:57:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This tripped me up as well, but I believe it\u0027s correct:\n\n- ARGBRotate90 advances the pointer for `src` (which is not transposed) to the last row by going `height-1` rows forward.\n- ARGBRotate270 advances the pointer for `dst` (which is transposed!) to the last row by going `width-1` rows forward.\n\nsrc height \u003d\u003d dst width",
      "parentUuid": "b6a5e78b_4788e826",
      "revId": "984da9e6d98a28866b84d482b8783e00062196cf",
